Conventions automation triggers and schedule
title end

paragraph start
A name audit runs after every batch of new files, before the tree is given to an AI, and once a week.
paragraph end

paragraph start
The audit lists the names that break the pattern, so a person or an AI reads a short report instead of the whole tree.
paragraph end

